    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DESCRIPTION & SCHEDULE OF ACCOMMODATION\n\nThis residence which was originally constructed circa 1973 forms part of a mature residential development situated in a desirable and convenient location. The accommodation comprises of:\n\nGROUND FLOOR\n\nENTRANCE PORCH:1.20m x 1.70m\nCeramic tile over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. \n\nSTORE:1.20m x 1.60m\nConcrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling.\n\nENTRANCE HALL:4.85m x 1.80m\nLaminate over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Under stairs storage.\n\nSITTING ROOM:4.85m x 3.00m\nLaminate over concrete floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Granite fireplace with granite hearth, surround & Timber over mantle. Ceiling and centrepiece coving.\n\nKITCHEN/DINING AREA:2.10m x 3.00m\nLinoleum over concrete floor. Ceramic tile on walls from floor to ceiling. Fitted kitchen with worktop and storage cabinets. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Exit door to rear garden.\n\nBATHROOM:2.00m x 1.80m\nCeramic tile - floor to ceiling. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Electric shower tray and cubicle. Wash hand basin with pedestal. Wall-hung mirror. Pan.\n\n1ST FLOOR\n\nLANDING:0.80m x 0.95m\nCarpet over timber stairs. Carpet over timber landing.\n\nMASTER BEDROOM:3.15m x 4.85m\nLaminate over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Extensive built-in wardrobes on either side of room. Bright and spacious.\n\nBEDROOM 2:3.80m x 2.60m\nLaminate over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Opening to attic. Wall-hung central heating radiator.\n\nBATHROOM:2.90m x 2.25m\nLinoleum over timber floor. Painted plastered walls and ceiling. Wall-hung central heating radiator. Quadrant shower tray with shower doors and electric shower. Wash hand basin with pedestal. Wall-hung mirror. Pan.\n\nParking in front drive and on street. Gardens at the front & side of the property.\n\nThe overall accommodation area measures approximately 70 m² (753.20 sq. ft.)\n\n\nSERVICES\n\nMains water, drainage to a septic tank, mains electricity, oil fired central heating.\n"
      },
